{{Collection Display}}

== Obtaining ==
=== Mob Drops ===
{{Drop Sources}}
The {{Item|Magma Necklace}} grants {{Green|10%}} more '''Magma Cream''' from killing Magma Cubes when equipped.

=== Minions ===
'''Magma Cream''' can be obtained from {{Item|Magma Cube Minion}}s.

=== Shop Purchase ===
'''Magma Cream''' can also be obtained by purchasing from the {{NPCSprite|Alchemist}} for {{C|20}} each.

