=== Quiver ===
'''Magma Cream''' can be placed in the [[Quiver]] to be used as projectiles for the {{Item|Magma Bow}}.

=== Kuudra Follower Boots ===
{{Item|Kuudra Follower Boots}} requires {{Green|1,000,000}} in Magma Cream Collection and {{Item|Enchanted Magma Cream|amount=1024}} to be given to {{Item|Kuudra Loremaster}} to claim the boots.

== Trivia ==
*'''Magma Cream''' can be stored in 3 different sacks ([[Nether Sack]], [[Lava Fishing Sack]] and [[Combat Sack]]) which is more than any other resource, except for {{Item|Netherrack}}, which can also be stored in 3 sacks.

